---
// LRU Doubly Linked List & HashMap Structure Diagram
---

<figure class="lru-diagram" aria-labelledby="lru-diagram-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG layout (ViewBox 820x220, generous padding and large legible fonts) -->
  <svg
    class="lru-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 820 220"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="lru-diagram-title lru-diagram-desc"
  >
    <title id="lru-diagram-title">LRU 雙向鏈表與 HashMap 索引結構圖</title>
    <desc id="lru-diagram-desc">
      展示最新存取節點移至 Head（最安全），最久未存取節點移至
      Tail（滿額淘汰），並透過 HashMap 達成 O(1) 直達索引與位移。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="lru-link-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="7"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="6"
        markerHeight="6"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z" class="lru-diagram__arrow-head"></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="lru-hash-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="7"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="6"
        markerHeight="6"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z" class="lru-diagram__arrow-head--hash"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Head Node (Most Recent) -->
    <g transform="translate(30, 30)">
      <rect
        width="160"
        height="76"
        rx="10"
        class="lru-diagram__node lru-diagram__node--head"></rect>
      <text
        class="lru-diagram__node-title lru-diagram__node-title--green"
        x="80"
        y="32"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        Head (最新存取)
      </text>
      <text class="lru-diagram__node-sub" x="80" y="56" text-anchor="middle">
        最安全・不淘汰
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Connector: Head <-> Node A -->
    <path
      d="M 200 60 H 225"
      class="lru-diagram__link-line"
      marker-end="url(#lru-link-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 225 76 H 200"
      class="lru-diagram__link-line"
      marker-end="url(#lru-link-arrow)"></path>

    <!-- Node A -->
    <g transform="translate(235, 30)">
      <rect width="140" height="76" rx="10" class="lru-diagram__node"></rect>
      <text class="lru-diagram__node-code" x="70" y="34" text-anchor="middle"
        >Node A</text
      >
      <text class="lru-diagram__node-desc" x="70" y="56" text-anchor="middle"
        >Key: "user:1"</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Connector: Node A <-> Node B -->
    <path
      d="M 385 60 H 410"
      class="lru-diagram__link-line"
      marker-end="url(#lru-link-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 410 76 H 385"
      class="lru-diagram__link-line"
      marker-end="url(#lru-link-arrow)"></path>

    <!-- Node B -->
    <g transform="translate(420, 30)">
      <rect width="140" height="76" rx="10" class="lru-diagram__node"></rect>
      <text class="lru-diagram__node-code" x="70" y="34" text-anchor="middle"
        >Node B</text
      >
      <text class="lru-diagram__node-desc" x="70" y="56" text-anchor="middle"
        >Key: "user:2"</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Connector: Node B <-> Tail -->
    <path
      d="M 570 60 H 595"
      class="lru-diagram__link-line"
      marker-end="url(#lru-link-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 595 76 H 570"
      class="lru-diagram__link-line"
      marker-end="url(#lru-link-arrow)"></path>

    <!-- Tail Node (Least Recent - Eviction Target) -->
    <g transform="translate(605, 30)">
      <rect
        width="180"
        height="76"
        rx="10"
        class="lru-diagram__node lru-diagram__node--tail"></rect>
      <text
        class="lru-diagram__node-title lru-diagram__node-title--red"
        x="90"
        y="32"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        Tail (最舊存取)
      </text>
      <text
        class="lru-diagram__node-sub--red"
        x="90"
        y="56"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        容量滿額 ➔ 優先驅逐！
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Bottom HashMap O(1) Index Bar -->
    <g transform="translate(130, 145)">
      <rect width="560" height="50" rx="10" class="lru-diagram__hash-card"
      ></rect>
      <text class="lru-diagram__hash-title" x="280" y="31" text-anchor="middle">
        HashMap 索引 (Key ➔ Node 指標)：O(1) 定位目標並重置至 Head
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Direct Index Pointers from Hash to Nodes -->
    <path
      d="M 305 145 V 116"
      class="lru-diagram__hash-line"
      marker-end="url(#lru-hash-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 490 145 V 116"
      class="lru-diagram__hash-line"
      marker-end="url(#lru-hash-arrow)"></path>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile vertical layout -->
  <div class="lru-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="lru-mobile-card lru-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="lru-mobile-badge lru-mobile-badge--green"
        >HEAD (MOST RECENT)</span
      >
      <h4>鏈表頭部：最新被存取節點</h4>
      <p>
        無論新寫入或舊資料被讀取，一律以 O(1) 移至
        Head。處於最安全防禦區，永不優先淘汰。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="lru-mobile-arrow">↕ 雙向指標鏈結 (Prev / Next)</div>

    <div class="lru-mobile-card">
      <span class="lru-mobile-badge">MIDDLE NODES</span>
      <h4>中間資料節點 (Node A / B ...)</h4>
      <p>
        維護前後節點雙向記憶體指標，被命中時透過 HashMap O(1) 摘除並重新插回
        Head。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="lru-mobile-arrow">↕ 雙向指標鏈結 (Prev / Next)</div>

    <div class="lru-mobile-card lru-mobile-card--red">
      <span class="lru-mobile-badge lru-mobile-badge--red"
        >TAIL (LEAST RECENT)</span
      >
      <h4>鏈表尾部：最舊存取 (驅逐目標)</h4>
      <p>
        長時間未被存取的資料逐漸沉降至
        Tail；當快取容量超過上限時，直接從尾部驅逐拋棄。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="lru-mobile-card lru-mobile-card--hash">
      <span class="lru-mobile-badge lru-mobile-badge--hash">HASHMAP INDEX</span>
      <h4>HashMap O(1) 直達索引</h4>
      <p>
        底層雜湊表直接映射 Key 到鏈表節點指標，擺脫 O(N) 遍歷開銷，保證讀寫均為
        O(1)。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="lru-diagram-caption">
    圖：LRU 核心資料結構 —— HashMap O(1) 索引搭配雙向鏈表動態頭尾重置
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .lru-diagram {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .lru-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .lru-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  /* SVG Base Tokens */
  .lru-diagram__node {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .lru-diagram__node--head {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.06);
    stroke: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .lru-diagram__node--head {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.14);
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .lru-diagram__node--tail {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.06);
    stroke: #dc2626;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .lru-diagram__node--tail {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.14);
    stroke: #f87171;
  }

  .lru-diagram__node-title {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .lru-diagram__node-title--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .lru-diagram__node-title--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .lru-diagram__node-title--red {
    fill: #b91c1c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .lru-diagram__node-title--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .lru-diagram__node-sub {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .lru-diagram__node-sub--red {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: #dc2626;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .lru-diagram__node-sub--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .lru-diagram__node-code {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .lru-diagram__node-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }

  .lru-diagram__link-line {
    stroke: #3b82f6;
    stroke-width: 2;
    fill: none;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .lru-diagram__link-line {
    stroke: #60a5fa;
  }

  .lru-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: #3b82f6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .lru-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: #60a5fa;
  }

  /* Bottom HashMap Bar */
  .lru-diagram__hash-card {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: #8b5cf6;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .lru-diagram__hash-card {
    stroke: #a78bfa;
    fill: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.12);
  }

  .lru-diagram__hash-title {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #7c3aed;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .lru-diagram__hash-title {
    fill: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .lru-diagram__hash-line {
    stroke: #8b5cf6;
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-dasharray: 4, 3;
    fill: none;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .lru-diagram__hash-line {
    stroke: #a78bfa;
  }

  .lru-diagram__arrow-head--hash {
    fill: #8b5cf6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .lru-diagram__arrow-head--hash {
    fill: #a78bfa;
  }

  figcaption {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* Mobile Breakpoint (≤ 48rem / 768px) */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .lru-diagram__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .lru-diagram__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .lru-mobile-card {
      background: var(--dg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      border-radius: 0.875rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .lru-mobile-card--green {
      border-left: 4px solid #16a34a;
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .lru-mobile-card--green {
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.1);
      border-color: #4ade80;
    }

    .lru-mobile-card--red {
      border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
      background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .lru-mobile-card--red {
      background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.1);
      border-color: #f87171;
    }

    .lru-mobile-card--hash {
      border-left: 4px solid #8b5cf6;
      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .lru-mobile-card--hash {
      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
      border-color: #a78bfa;
    }

    .lru-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    }

    .lru-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #16a34a;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .lru-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #86efac;
    }

    .lru-mobile-badge--red {
      color: #dc2626;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .lru-mobile-badge--red {
      color: #fca5a5;
    }

    .lru-mobile-badge--hash {
      color: #8b5cf6;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .lru-mobile-badge--hash {
      color: #c4b5fd;
    }

    .lru-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .lru-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .lru-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      padding: 0.125rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
